---
import { seedsFlow } from '../data/site';
---

<section id="seeds" class="relative overflow-hidden py-24 lg:py-40">
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 size-[80vw] max-w-[900px] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full opacity-35"
    style="background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(224,169,87,0.16), rgba(224,169,87,0.05) 42%, transparent 72%)"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-6 lg:px-10">
    <hr class="rule rule-fade mb-24 lg:mb-32" />
    <div class="grid items-center gap-16 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-20">
      <!-- Hueco reservado de la moneda (el 3D se retiró temporalmente;
           quedan el halo y los anillos orbitales para mantener la composición) -->
      <div class="order-2 lg:order-1 lg:col-span-5">
        <div data-reveal="scale" class="relative mx-auto aspect-square w-full max-w-[340px]">
          <div
            class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-[-18%] rounded-full opacity-70"
            style="background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(224,169,87,0.22), rgba(224,169,87,0.07) 45%, transparent 70%)"
            aria-hidden="true"
          ></div>
          <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-[-12%] animate-[spin_28s_linear_infinite] rounded-full border border-dashed border-gold/20" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-[-24%] animate-[spin_46s_linear_infinite_reverse] rounded-full border border-gold/10" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="order-1 lg:order-2 lg:col-span-7">
        <p data-reveal="wipe" class="eyebrow mb-5">La moneda · Seeds</p>
        <h2 data-reveal="mask" style="--reveal-delay:90ms" class="text-[length:var(--text-display)]">
          Tu poder<br /> en el <span class="text-gilded">juego</span>.
        </h2>
        <p data-reveal="up" style="--reveal-delay:200ms" class="mt-8 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-mist">
          Las Seeds son la moneda de Chess Fortune. No son un adorno: son la apuesta, el premio y la llave de acceso a las mesas altas. Un ciclo cerrado y transparente.
        </p>

        <ol class="mt-14 space-y-3">
          {seedsFlow.map((f, i) => (
            <li
              data-reveal="right"
              style={`--reveal-delay:${i * 120}ms`}
              class="spotlight group relative grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-6 overflow-hidden rounded-card border border-line/60 bg-surface/30 p-7 transition-all duration-500 hover:border-gold/40 hover:bg-surface/70 sm:grid-cols-[7rem_1fr] sm:gap-10"
            >
              <span class="font-display text-2xl text-gold">{f.step}</span>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-lg text-white">{f.title}</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-mist">{f.body}</p>
              </div>
              <span class="absolute bottom-4 left-0 top-4 w-px origin-top scale-y-0 rounded-full bg-gold transition-transform duration-600 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] group-hover:scale-y-100" />
            </li>
          ))}
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
</style>

